OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fmostly dry this evening with the odd
OL,7,Fshower. Cloud will increase overnight
OL,8,Fwith some rain reaching the west in
OL,9,Fthe early hours. A mild night for most.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FRain quickly spreading
OL,12,Facross the region, leading to a rather
OL,13,Fwet morning. Some drier and brighter
OL,14,Fspells developing later on, but
OL,15,Ffurther showers are possible.
OL,16,FBreezier, but feeling humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
