OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FStaying changeable on Thursday and
OL,7,FFriday. Often blustery with rain at
OL,8,Ftimes, but feeling humid in any
OL,9,Fbrightness. Largely fine on Saturday
OL,10,Fwith some warm sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
